#. とにかく…消えた２人の死体を探すぞ。
#. 話はそれからだ…
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We need to search for the bodies that have\n"
"disappeared. What happens after that..."
msgstr ""

#. ２人の死体…
#. どこに…消えちゃったんだろ…
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Where could two dead bodies have disappeared to...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 気にしてもしょうがない、放っておこう。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's not much point in worrying about it now. I\n"
"should try to just forget about it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで…黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now, the mastermind is probably on the other side\n"
"of that surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう思うとムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just thinking about it puts me on edge...but there's\n"
"nothing I can really do about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガタガタガタ！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鍵が掛かってるみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door must be locked...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…モノクマの像か…
#. さすがに事件には関係ないはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this...a statue of Monokuma? It doesn't have\n"
"anything I need, so let's...get away from it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…ビーナス像か…
#. 美術室らしいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...a Venus statue. Seems like something you'd find\n"
"in an art room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特に気になる事はないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think there's anything important here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁一面に絵が張られている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are paintings lining the walls.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特に気になる事はないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see anything out of the ordinary about them.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、仁王像だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is a statue of Nio.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特に気になる事はないか…
#. この像自体が意味不明だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think there's anything important here. The\n"
"statue itself is kind of...incomprehensible.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーがある…
#. けど、気になる物はない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a locker. But there's nothing too remarkable\n"
"about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0018 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0019 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
